    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3767" root="تبن" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَّانٌ</span></b>  <i>A seller of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِبْن</span>: (S, M, K:) thus, perfectly
decl., if of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعَّال</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التِّبْنُ</span>: but if
of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعْلَان</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّبُّ</span> [the act of
cutting (for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِبْن</span> is generally cut by the thrashingmachine)], it is [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَّانُ</span>,] imperfectly decl. (S.)

